{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Companion twist: B/C operators and SoV bases (gl(3), L=1)\n\nSingle site in the adjoint $\\Lambda=\\{2,1,0\\}$ (dim 8), companion twist $G$ with parameters $\\chi_a$. Builds the $B$/$C$ operators, the left/right SoV bases $\\langle x_A|$, $|y_B\\rangle$ from fused transfer matrices acting on the vacua, and checks their overlap matrix.\n\n*Converted from `Companion-B-C-diagonalize.nb` (2026-09-25).*",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## gl(3) generators in the Gelfand–Tsetlin basis",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ps[rep_] :=\n  ps[rep] = \n   Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #] & /@ (Tuples[\n          Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, \n            Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]))}, \n    If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse@Sort@res, \n     Reverse@Sort@Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := \n  J0[k][pat] = \n   Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := \n  Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[\n     Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, \n         Range[k + 1]}]/\n       Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, \n         Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[\n       ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := \n  Jm[k][pat] = \n   Sum[Product[\n       pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/\n      Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, \n        Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[\n      ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := \n  JJ[k, l, rep] = \n   Which[k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]], l == k + 1, \n    Transpose[\n     Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ \n       ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l == k - 1, \n    Transpose[\n     Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ \n       ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l > k + 1, \n    JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - \n     JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep], l < k - 1, \n    JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - \n     JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Representation, Lax matrix, companion twist",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[\\[CapitalLambda], \\[Nu]];\n\\[CapitalLambda][1] = {2, 1, 0};\n\\[Nu][n_][u_] := \n  Product[(u - \\[Theta][l] - h \\[CapitalLambda][l][[n]]), {l, 1}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[\\[ScriptCapitalL], T, TG, Ee, EE];\nEe[\\[Alpha]_][i_, j_] := \n  Ee[\\[Alpha]][i, j] = JJ[i, j, \\[CapitalLambda][\\[Alpha]]];\nEE[i_, j_] := Ee[1][i, j];\n\\[ScriptCapitalL][\\[Alpha]_][i_, j_][u_] := \\[ScriptCapitalL][\\[Alpha]][i, j][u] = \n  u IdentityMatrix[dim[\\[CapitalLambda][\\[Alpha]]]] KroneckerDelta[i, j] - h Ee[\\[Alpha]][j, i];\n(* companion twist; Gm = G - 1 is kept for the small-twist expansion below *)\nG = {{\\[Chi][1], \\[Chi][2], \\[Chi][3]}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nGm = G - IdentityMatrix[3];\nT[{i_, j_}][u_] := T[{i, j}][u] = \\[ScriptCapitalL][1][i, j][u - \\[Theta][1]];\nTG[{i_, j_}][u_] := \n  TG[{i, j}][u] = \n   Sum[\\[ScriptCapitalL][1][i, k][u - \\[Theta][1]] G[[k, j]], {k, 3}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Quantum minors and fused transfer matrices",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[QM, tG, QMG];\nQM[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := \n  QM[Ii, Jj][u] = \n   Sum[Signature[\n      Permutations[\n        Ii][[\\[Sigma]]]] (Dot @@ (T[#][\n           u + h - h Position[\n                Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}], #] // \n             Flatten // Last] & /@ \n         Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}])), {\\[Sigma], \n     1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\nQMG[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := \n  QMG[Ii, Jj][u] = \n   Sum[Signature[\n      Permutations[\n        Ii][[\\[Sigma]]]] (Dot @@ (TG[#][\n           u + h - h Position[\n                Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}], #] // \n             Flatten // Last] & /@ \n         Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}])), {\\[Sigma], \n     1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\ntG[a_][u_] := \n  tG[a][u] = Sum[QMG[Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[t, tS];\nt[{0, 0}][u_] := t[{0, 0}][u] = IdentityMatrix[8];\nt[{1, 0}][u_] := t[{1, 0}][u] = tG[1][u] // Simplify;\nt[{1, 1}][u_] := t[{1, 1}][u] = tG[2][u] // Simplify;\nt[{2, 0}][u_] := \n  t[{2, 0}][u] = tG[1][u] . tG[1][u + h] - tG[2][u + h] // Simplify;\nt[{2, 1}][u_] := \n  t[{2, 1}][u] = tG[2][u] . tG[1][u + h] - tG[3][u + h] // Simplify;\nt[{2, 2}][u_] := \n  t[{2, 2}][u] = \n   tG[2][u] . tG[2][u + h] - tG[3][u + h] . tG[1][u] // Simplify;\n(* shifted versions used to build the right basis *)\ntS[{1, 0}][u_] = t[{1, 0}][u];\ntS[{1, 1}][u_] = t[{1, 1}][u + h];\ntS[{2, 0}][u_] = t[{2, 0}][u - h];\ntS[{2, 1}][u_] = (tG[2][u + h] . tG[1][u - h] - tG[3][u + h]);",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### General fused transfer matrices via Cherednik–Bazhanov–Reshetikhin\n$\\mathbb{T}_\\lambda(u)=\\det_{1\\le i,j\\le\\lambda_1}\\mathbb{T}_{\\lambda'_j+i-j,1}(u+\\hbar(i-1))$, with $\\mathbb{T}_{a,1}=$ `tG[a]` (antisymmetric), $\\mathbb{T}_{0,1}=1$, and $\\mathbb{T}_{a,1}=0$ for $a<0$ or $a>3$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[tA, tCBR, conjP];\n(* antisymmetric (column) transfer matrices, extended by 1 and 0 outside 1..3 *)\ntA[a_][u_] := Which[a == 0, IdentityMatrix[dim[\\[CapitalLambda][1]]], a < 0 || a > 3, ConstantArray[0, {1, 1} dim[\\[CapitalLambda][1]]], True, tG[a][u]];\nconjP[lam_] := Table[Count[lam, x_ /; x >= j], {j, 1, Max[lam, 0]}];\n(* transfer matrices commute, so the determinant can be expanded with Dot in row order *)\ntCBR[lam_][u_] := tCBR[lam][u] = With[{l1 = Max[lam, 0], lp = conjP[lam]},\n   If[l1 == 0, tA[0][u],\n    Sum[Signature[p] (Dot @@ Table[tA[lp[[p[[i]]]] + i - p[[i]]][u + h (i - 1)], {i, l1}]), {p, Permutations[Range[l1]]}]]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* check CBR against the hand-written adjoint t's at a random numeric point *)\nWith[{pt = {u -> 3/7, h -> 2/5, \\[Theta][1] -> 1/3, \\[Chi][1] -> 5/11, \\[Chi][2] -> -2/7, \\[Chi][3] -> 3/13}},\n Table[lam -> (((tCBR[lam][u] - t[lam][u]) /. pt) // Simplify // Flatten // Union), {lam, {{0, 0}, {1, 0}, {1, 1}, {2, 0}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}}}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"68\" data-out-n=\"432\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"11\" data-sub-start=\"1\" data-sub-end=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[432]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[432]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\left\\{0,0\\right\\}\\to \\left\\{0\\right\\},\\left\\{1,0\\right\\}\\to \\left\\{0\\right\\},\\left\\{1,1\\right\\}\\to \\left\\{0\\right\\},\\left\\{2,0\\right\\}\\to \\left\\{0\\right\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\left\\{2,1\\right\\}\\to \\left\\{0\\right\\},\\left\\{2,2\\right\\}\\to \\left\\{0\\right\\}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "0ec4b07f-a8db-4528-9efc-df110c66531a"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## B and C operators",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "B[u_] = T[{1, 1}][u] . QM[{1, 2}, {1, 2}][u + h] + \n   T[{2, 1}][u] . QM[{1, 2}, {1, 3}][u + h];\nCc[u_] = \n  T[{1, 1}][u] . QM[{1, 2}, {1, 2}][u] + \n   T[{2, 1}][u] . QM[{1, 2}, {1, 3}][u];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "vacL = {{0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1}};\nvacR = {{1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}} // Transpose;\nvac2 = vacR // Transpose;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* is vac2 . t(v) a left eigenvector of B(u), and for which v? *)\nvac2 . t[{1, 0}][v] . B[u] - \\[Lambda] vac2 . t[{1, 0}][v];\nSolve[% == 0, {\\[Lambda], v}] // Factor\nvac2 . t[{1, 1}][v] . B[u] - \\[Lambda] vac2 . t[{1, 1}][v];\nSolve[% == 0, {\\[Lambda], v}] // Factor",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"0\" data-out-n=\"39\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"12\" data-sub-start=\"2\" data-sub-end=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[39]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XHtcfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[39]= \\{\\}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "aed504ce-be9e-495d-95d0-c9caba3c8722"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"1\" data-out-n=\"41\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"12\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"4\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[41]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:5.1em;vertical-align:-2.3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.8em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.3em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.8em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">{</span></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"