  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Overlap matrix $\\langle x_A|y_B\\rangle$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* h -> 1 locally only: h stays symbolic for the expansions further down *)\nTable[x[A[[1]]] . y[A[[2]]], {A, gtpairs}] /. h -> 1",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
